description:
You need a plan.
Actually, you need many plans.
Or even better, you need Plans.TheApp

Why?

- because the “monthly budget” never tells the full story;
- because real life is lumpy: rent steps up, one-offs appear out of nowhere and somehow the math never matches the month;
- because nobody needs another expense tracker; 
- everybody needs a way to see the full picture.

How?

- you make a plan: in
